tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Stripe以75亿美元收购AI模型路由平台OpenRouter</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI企业市场份额反超Anthropic，AI支出持续扩张</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Gemma系列开源大模型全球下载量突破10亿次大关</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手发布2026年二季度财报：总营收355亿元，可灵AI商业化收入同比增长超200%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2c2feaa9eb0455848b4c03bed485c916.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">快手科技发布2026年二季度财报，总营收达355亿元，经调整净利润39亿元。AI业务表现亮眼，可灵AI二季度收入超8.5亿元，同比增长超200%，全球用户突破1亿，覆盖224个国家和地区，企业客户近5万家。产品端，可灵AI 3.0系列推出原生4K视频直出功能，3.0 Turbo提升了音画同步与生成效率，并支持AI Agent批量调用。内部运营方面，超92%员工使用自研AI Agent，研发人员AI代码贡献率达60%，需求交付周期缩短超10%。在商业化层面，AI驱动短剧供给增长，真人与AI短剧供给较年初增长超5倍，短剧营销消耗同比增长超100%。此外，超85万商家使用快手AI经营工具，AIGC短视频营销消耗同比增长超70%。快手正通过AI视频生成、大模型及智能Agent技术，全面重构内容生态与商业经营效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宇树科技发布仿生7轴灵巧机械臂R1，起售价9900元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/005ab36362d1cc71b0d0346919812c2d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">宇树科技于8月20日正式发布仿生7轴灵巧机械臂R1，起售价9900元。该产品采用七轴联动设计，重复定位精度达0.1毫米，最大臂展650毫米，额定负载2公斤，整机自重仅5.5公斤。R1内置力反馈与碰撞检测功能，支持位置与力矩混合控制，基于Ubuntu开发环境，配备XT30与CAN485接口，官方计划陆续开源控制程序及接口。其桌面级形态支持“即放即用”，末端可快速换装夹爪或灵巧手。宇树科技将R1定位为民用机器人，核心应用场景涵盖科研教育、工业装配、智能交互及服务机器人领域。官方提示，由于关节减速比较低，整机位置控制刚度有限，动态作业中可能存在位置误差，建议用户针对实际场景进行调试，并避免危险性改造。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Stripe以75亿美元收购AI模型路由平台OpenRouter</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3e893bf76cd8ff854c424e8e29d4993e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">全球支付巨头Stripe正式确认以75亿美元收购AI模型路由与网关平台OpenRouter，该交易金额较OpenRouter今年5月B轮融资时的13亿美元估值增长超5倍。OpenRouter作为AI基础设施，提供统一入口将请求动态路由至400至500个主流模型，目前拥有超1000万用户，日处理token量突破10万亿。合并后，OpenRouter将保持原名称与使命独立运营，核心产品路线图不变，交易预计在未来数周内完成。Stripe此次收购意在将模型选择与路由机制深度整合至其支付计量栈，通过将支付系统与推理路由层结合，精准掌控Agent经济下的token消耗流，从而卡位AI消费与智能经济运转的核心节点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI企业市场份额反超Anthropic，AI支出持续扩张</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96a1bae977b7f3e2593c5df65697f51c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI企业市场份额反超Anthropic，AI支出持续扩张AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Aug 21, 20268企业信用卡与费用管理平台Ramp最新数据显示，OpenAI在美国企业AI市场的份额已重新超过Anthropic。数据显示，今年5月Anthropic曾以41%的市场份额领先OpenAI的39%。截至7月，Anthropic份额接近44%，OpenAI则接近40%。Ramp经济学家Ara Kharazian表示，进入第三季度以来，OpenAI在该领域的增长速度已超过Anthropic。该数据覆盖超过7万家美国企业，这些企业通过Ramp的账单支付及企业信用卡产品产生数十亿美元支出，客户以科技行业企业为主。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Gemma系列开源大模型全球下载量突破10亿次大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bbd94d914a396e4e2cbb7b2d5c36f9ec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind宣布Gemma系列开源大模型全球下载量正式突破10亿次，开发者已构建超十万个模型变体。Gemma凭借高灵活性广泛应用于各类极端环境，包括NASA等机构在轨运行该模型进行星载图像分析与通信路由。在医疗领域，印度NHA将Gemma4整合至Aarogya Setu 2.0处理医疗数据，耶鲁大学基于Gemma构建的C2S-Scale模型成功发现新型癌症治疗途径，MedGemma则被用于临床分诊。此外，研究人员还开发了DolphinGemma用于海豚发声分析。为支持生态发展，Google在GitHub正式推出“Awesome Gemma”资源库，汇集社区项目、微调模型及工具，持续推动AI在视障辅助、离线教育等社会公益领域的应用落地。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
